<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Quickstart</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Deserialization</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Here<sp/>is<sp/>a<sp/>program<sp/>that<sp/>parses<sp/>a<sp/>JSON<sp/>document<sp/>with<sp/>ArduinoJson.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```c++</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">char<sp/>json[]<sp/>=<sp/>&quot;{\&quot;sensor\&quot;:\&quot;gps\&quot;,\&quot;time\&quot;:1351824120,\&quot;data\&quot;:[48.756080,2.302038]}&quot;;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">DynamicJsonDocument<sp/>doc(1024);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">deserializeJson(doc,<sp/>json);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">const<sp/>char*<sp/>sensor<sp/>=<sp/>doc[&quot;sensor&quot;];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">long<sp/>time<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>=<sp/>doc[&quot;time&quot;];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">double<sp/>latitude<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>=<sp/>doc[&quot;data&quot;][0];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">double<sp/>longitude<sp/><sp/><sp/>=<sp/>doc[&quot;data&quot;][1];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">See<sp/>the<sp/>[tutorial<sp/>on<sp/>arduinojson.org](https://arduinojson.org/v6/doc/deserialization/)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Serialization</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Here<sp/>is<sp/>a<sp/>program<sp/>that<sp/>generates<sp/>a<sp/>JSON<sp/>document<sp/>with<sp/>ArduinoJson:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```c++</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">DynamicJsonDocument<sp/>doc(1024);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
